# W - Export a cpmsim file to the host

```text
W CP/M-filespec [host-file]
```

## Export a file

```text
W D0:SOURCE.ASM "Edited source.asm"
```

Give one CP/M filename and a host filename in the emulator's working
directory. Quote host names containing spaces. W accepts single names
without host directory prefixes or wildcards.

## Import the result

```text
R "Edited source.asm" D0:NEW.ASM
```

[R](R.HLP) brings the host file back under a CP/M 8.3 name. W and R are
supplied on the cpmsim System disk.
